# ATG-M Cursor Rules

## Project Context
- Movement L1 native treasury management
- Move smart contracts (Aptos dialect)
- Next.js 14 frontend with TypeScript
- HuggingFace AI integration
- No EVM/Ethereum references

## Code Style
- TypeScript strict mode
- Functional React components
- Tailwind CSS for styling
- No markdown symbols in UI text
- Clean transitions (fade, not scroll)

## Movement/Move Specific
- Use @aptos-labs/ts-sdk for Movement
- Movement uses Aptos Move dialect
- View functions are gas-free
- Always verify signer in mutations
- Event emission for auditability

## AI Integration
- HuggingFace Inference API
- Structured JSON output required
- Always include fallback logic
- Never return empty responses

## Testing
- Test on Movement testnet first
- Verify transactions on explorer
- Check wallet compatibility
- Monitor HF API rate limits

